BIZ-PLAN-LIFESTYLE.md export-ignore
MAINTAINING.md export-ignore

# SDD process docs — internal artefacts, never ship in `git archive`.
# (Repo browsing on GitHub still shows them; future publish flow may move
# specs to a separate repo. For the tarball, this is enough.)
specs/ export-ignore
